<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Unbound by Himanshi</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300&底display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #fdfbf7;
            --text-color: #2c2c2c;
            --accent-color: #8e8e8e;
        }

        body, html {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        /* --- Intro Animation --- */
        #intro-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #87CEEB, #ffffff);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            transition: transform 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.3, 1);
        }

        .plane {
            font-size: 50px;
            animation: takeOff 4s forwards ease-in-out;
            position: absolute;
        }

        .intro-text {
            text-align: center;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeIn 2s 2s forwards;
        }

        .intro-text h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        @keyframes takeOff {
            0% { transform: translate(-150%, 100%) rotate(-15deg); opacity: 1; }
            40% { transform: translate(0%, 0%) rotate(-25deg); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: translate(200%, -200%) rotate(-35deg); opacity: 0; }
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* --- Main Content --- */
        main {
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 1s ease;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section {
            min-height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        /* --- Page Turn Effect --- */
        .book-container {
            perspective: 1500px;
            margin: 50px 0;
        }

        .page {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 1s cubic-bezier(0.645, 0.045, 0.355, 1);
            transform-origin: left;
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
        }

        .page.flipped {
            transform: rotateY(-160deg);
        }

        .page-back {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: #f9f9f9;
            backface-visibility: hidden;
            transform: rotateY(180deg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 40px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .hint {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .final-reveal {
            margin-top: 100px;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            padding-top: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 100px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="intro-overlay">
        <div class="plane">✈️</div>
        <div class="intro-text" id="intro-text-box">
            <h1>Unbound by Himanshi</h1>
            <p>— For every life that seeks to be its own 🤍</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main id="main-content">
        <section class="section">
            <p>Freedom begins the moment you choose yourself.</p>
            <p>In the quiet decisions no one claps for.</p>
            <p>It begins when you say no without guilt.</p>
            <p>When you stop shrinking to fit spaces that were never meant for you.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="book-container">
            <div class="page" id="flippablePage" onclick="flipPage()">
                <div class="page-front">
                    <p>Choosing yourself doesn’t mean you stop loving others.</p>
                    <p>It means you stop abandoning yourself in the process.</p>
                    <p class="hint">(Tap to turn the page)</p>
                </div>
                <div class="page-back">
                    <div>
                        <p>It’s in walking away & in staying with what feels true.</p>
                        <p>In allowing your life to take a shape that feels like home to you.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="final-reveal">
            <p>Your time on this earth is not meant to be a performance for others.</p>
            <p><strong>It is yours.</strong></p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script>
        // Sequence the intro
        window.addEventListener('load', () => {
            const overlay = document.getElementById('intro-overlay');
            const main = document.getElementById('main-content');
            
            // Wait 6 seconds (plane + text display) then drop the intro
            setTimeout(() => {
                overlay.style.transform = 'translateY(-100%)';
                main.style.opacity = '1';
            }, 6000);
        });

        // Handle page flip
        function flipPage() {
            document.getElementById('flippablePage').classList.toggle('flipped');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
